{"title": "Qweryin", "pageid": 2042, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Placeholder\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Placeholder\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"300\">File:Placeholder</span></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p><b>Qweryin</b>, Master of the Line, hails from House of Barimen in the Courts of Tumba. In and undisclosed time period prior to the main story Qweryin obtained the Left Eye of the Serpent through methods unknown, Qweryin fled into <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a> and met the Unicorn. With her help and using the Eye, he inscribed the Primal <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\">Pattern</a> giving form to Yander. <a href=\"/wiki/Chronoron\" title=\"Chronoron\">Chronoron</a>, first king of Yander, is reportedly the offspring of Qweryin and the Unicorn\n</p><p><br />\nThroughout countless ages, Qweryin stayed in Yander as an advisor and teacher of the powers of <a href=\"/wiki/Trumps\" title=\"Trumps\">Trumps</a>, with frequent absences to places unknown. His students include Chronoron's children <a href=\"/wiki/Bleys\" title=\"Bleys\">Bleys</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jon\" title=\"Jon\">Jon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Shriona\" title=\"Shriona\">Shriona</a>. When the Pattern was disrupted, Qweryin went mad and was imprisoned by Chronoron. At least, that was the intent; Qweryin proved quite capable of leaving his prison. During Pavel's imprisonment in the Yander dungeons, Qweryin helped <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a> escape using a Trump of Cabra Lighthouse he drew on the dungeon wall.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Qweryin?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260430112204\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.449      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.449      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2042-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260430112204 and revision id 4450. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Bleys", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Jon", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Pavel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Shriona", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Chronoron", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Shadow", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Pattern", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Trumps", "exists": true}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/Qweryin"}